  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene okonachera Abaisraeli ekiina ase engencho y’ogosasiima kwabo kw’emegwekano",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Beka egetureeri monwa mokebugie! Omobisa ngocha are igoro y’enyomba y’Omonene buna ekeongo, ekiagera abanto basaririe okobwatana kwane kw’ogotianania, na batigire amachiiko aane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli nigo bakorera ase ’nde, kera oyomo oteeba: Aye Nyasae one, intwe Abaisraeli ntokomanyete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bangire amang’ana are amaya, ase ayio ababisa mbaababwatie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abaisraeli bebeekeire abarwoti, batamboreti, bebeekeire abagaambi abwo ntamanyeti, na korwa ase chifeta ne chitaabu chiabo beroiseirie emegwekano bagosasiima; ayio nigo arabarentere ogosirigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Samaria, omogwekano oria bw’emori ore ase egati yao yabeire okogechia ase ’nde. Endamwamu yane nigo egwoka igoro y’abanto abwo. Ngoika ririri baragenderere koba iga bataracheneka?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omogwekano oyio nigo oruete ase Abaisraeli. Nigo oroisetigwe nomooroisia bw’ebinto, oyio tari oro Nyasae. Omogwekano oria bw’emori ore Samaria nosenyentwe obe ebisamunye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abwo babusuire embeo, mbagese ekembugu‐mbugu. Ebimeri bigokina ase emegondo yabo tibigosomoria, ase ayio tibikwama chindagera. Biise kwama, abanto b’ebisaku ebigeni mbache bachigese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bamerirwe. Bono nigo bare ase egati y’ebisaku baabarire koba buna egekorero getagwenereti kende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagendire Asuri, babeire buna etigere y’orosana ere ao yoka; ee, Abaefraimu benyoreire abanchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, nonya benyoreire abanto b’ebisaku ebiaao ng’a baabakonye, nimbasangererie amo bwango, mbakeyie babe inse y’ogochandwa kw’omorwoti oria bw’abagaambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekiagera Abaefraimu beagacheire ebisasimero ebinge bikogera bakore ebibe, ebio biabeire ebibe ase bare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya nare korika amachiiko aane ase bare ara chilifu ikomi, tibaare koyancha, korende bayabarire koba egento ekegeni ase bare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo banchete korua ebing’wanso ase ’nde, erinde barie chinyama chi’ebing’wanso ebio, korende inche Omonene timbagokereti. Bono ning’inyore okomocha kwabo mbae egesusuro ase engencho y’ebibe biabo; barabwo bairane gochia Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abaisraeli bebire Omotongi obo, baagachire chinyomba chi’obonene, na Abayuda baagachire emechie emenge egiteire chindwaki, korende nindete omorero ase emechie eyio, na oro nosambe amaagacho abo bagwekengera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
